        "description": {
          "text": "Updated clinical trials labeling to include information about patients with baseline Staphylococcus aureus bacteremia in cSSSI and HABP/VABP",
          "citations": [
            {
              "quote": "This Prior Approval supplemental new drug application provides for revisions to the **CLINICAL TRIALS** section (14), Complicated Skin and Skin Structure Infections (14.1) and Hospital-Acquired Bacterial Pneumonia/Ventilator-Associated Bacterial Pneumonia (HABP/VABP) (14.2) subsections to include information about patients with baseline bacteraemia caused by *Staphylococcus aureus*.",
